cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The Untraceable Protocol
message: >-
  If you reference this specification, please cite it as below.
type: standard
abstract: >-
  An open specification for auditable AI use on confidential data. It defines
  the record an organization should be able to produce for any AI-assisted
  deliverable — what was cloaked, submitted, returned and reviewed — with real
  confidential values never appearing in the record.
authors:
  - name: Untraceable AI
    website: "https://theuntraceable.ai"
url: "https://theuntraceable.ai/protocol"
repository-code: "https://github.com/UntraceableAI/untraceable-protocol"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-13"
keywords:
  - confidential AI
  - auditability
  - HEOR
  - compliance
  - specification
